OL,9,     Fgetaway.
OL,10,G1200 Traffic Cops
OL,11,     FA driver disastrously misjudges an
OL,12,     Fovertaking manoeuvre, while
OL,13,     Fanother falls asleep at the wheel
OL,14,     Fon the M1 motorway.
OL,15,G1300 Traffic Cops
OL,16,     FRoad crime cops Nick Lovatt and
OL,17,     FMark Scott from Derbyshire's
OL,18,     FSpecialist ANPR crime unit target
OL,19,     Fdrug dealers coming into the
OL,20,     Fcounty from other areas.
