OL,5,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FIrene arrives at Hall Green
OL,7,     FHealth, Birmingham, with a nasty
OL,8,     Ffoot infection. Farhan sees Dr
OL,9,     FWard as he is struggling with a
OL,10,     Ftight chest and feelings of
OL,11,     Fsuffocation in enclosed spaces.
OL,12,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,13,     FThe pace at Barnsley Casualty is
OL,14,     Frelentless; other hospitals in the
OL,15,     Farea are full and as a result,
OL,16,     Fambulances are being diverted to
OL,17,     FBarnsley.
OL,18,G2100 Ambulance: Code Red
OL,19,     FA pair of air ambulance teams
OL,20,     Frespond to a serious accident
OL,21,     Fwhere one passenger was thrown out
OL,22,     Fwhile the driver remains trapped.
