OL,5,G0000 999: Killer On The Line
OL,6,     FExamining the case of Darren
OL,7,     FByrne, a former city trader who
OL,8,     Fkilled his wife and then tried to
OL,9,     Fburn down the family home after
OL,10,     Fshe discovered that he was having
OL,11,     Fan affair.
OL,12,G0100 Cold Case Killers
OL,13,     FWhen 77-year-old Georgina Edmonds
OL,14,     Fis murdered in her Hampshire
OL,15,     Fcottage, the community believes
OL,16,     Fthe killer must be an outsider,
OL,17,     Fbut the police are baffled by a
OL,18,     Fseries of dead ends.
